/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 49 0 R
/T (IF length\(readings\) < 7 THEN return empty list. SET window_sum to sum of first seven readings. APPEND window_sum/7. FOR each next index: subtract the value leaving the window, add the new value, append the average. RETURN results.)
/E (IF length\(readings\) < 7 THEN return empty list. SET window_sum to sum of first seven readings. APPEND window_sum/7. FOR each next index: subtract the value leaving the window, add the new value, append the average. RETURN results.)
