/Title (Use intersection \(&\) for students in both electives, symmetric difference \(^\) for students in exactly one, union \(|\) for everyone registered, and difference \(-\) from all_students for students in neither. Sets automatically remove duplicates and provide average O\(1\) membership tests.)
