/Title (A list comprehension has the form [expression for item in iterable if condition]. Use a loop when the logic has multiple branches or side effects. A dictionary comprehension maps minute to temperature; a set comprehension extracts distinct alarm temperatures. A generator expression produces values lazily and generally uses less memory than materialising a list.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 429 0 R
>>
endobj
