<<
/Title (A function receives a reference to the same mutable list object, so mutations are visible to the caller. sys.getsizeof reports only the container's shallow size, not all referenced elements. Compare list and tuple sizes on the same interpreter and data. A tuple containing a list can still have that list mutated; tuple immutability protects the tuple's references, not nested objects.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 481 0 R
>>
endobj
