516 0 obj
<<
/Title (Python 3.7+ guarantees insertion order for dictionaries. keys\(\), values\(\) and items\(\) return dynamic view objects that reflect later dictionary changes. For ties, the key \(-count, word\) sorts highest counts first and alphabetically.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 485 0 R
>>
endobj
517 0 obj
<<
/Title (Sets are unordered and discard duplicate counts and original ordering. Convert results to sorted lists for deterministic reports. Lists cannot be set members because they are mutable; tuples of hashable values can be members.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 487 0 R
>>
endobj
